1487:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  00B InBet / The ramping oscillator's output frequency is between the base frequency and the upp
1488:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  01B AtBase / The ramping oscillator's output frequency equals the base frequency which is 100 M
1489:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  10B AtTop / The ramping oscillator's output frequency equals the upper frequency limit.
