1813:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h **** /** \brief API to get actual PER PLL1  frequency
1814:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * This API returns the PER PLL1 frequency based on the K2 divider value in PLLCON and the VCO freq
1815:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Fpll1= (Fosc*N)/(P*K2).
